001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.    TCOREXEC.
001300 AUTHOR.        LYNN M. BUNN.
001400*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR.
001500 DATE-WRITTEN.  SEPTEMBER 27, 1983.
001600 DATE-COMPILED.
001700*REMARKS.         RECEIVING SLIP CORRECTIONS PROGRAM.
001800*************************************************************
001900*************************************************************
002000***                     C O R E X E C                     ***
002100***                                                       ***
002200***        THIS IS THE MAIN PROGRAM FOR MODIFYING         ***
002300***     RECEIVING SLIPS.  PURCHASE ORDER, RELEASE,        ***
002400***     AND RECEIVING NUMBER IS ENTERED AND VALIDATED.    ***
002500***     SPOOLER NUMBER DEFAULTS ARE DISPLAYED (UP TO 3)   ***
002600***     AND MAY BE MODIFIED BY THE USER.  THIS IS TO      ***
002700***     ALLOW SOME RECEIVING SLIP CORRECTIONS TO BE       ***
002800***     PRINTED IN AREAS OTHER THAN THE DOCK.             ***
002900***     ANY SPOOLER NUMBER CHANGES AREA VALIDATED.        ***
004800*                                                           *
004900*                        FILES                              *
005000*        INPUT:                                             *
005100*              VALIDRCV.PUB - VALID RECEIVING DOCKS         *
005200*                             AND DEPARTMENTS. (AKRON ONLY) *
005300*              DIRDEL.PUB   - TABLE OF DIRECT DELIVERY      *
005400*                             ITEMS FOR EACH SUBPLANT.      *
005500*                                                           *
005600*        OUTPUT:                                            *
005700*              NONE                                         *
005800*************************************************************
      *C SEPTEMBER 24, 1992 - JEFF BUNGO   (006264)               *
      *C   ADDED A READ TO MPLTINFO TO RETRIEVE THE PLANT SWITCH  *
      *C   FOR P326 TO PASS TO SCORRCVR.                          *
005900*************************************************************
008800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
008900 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
009000 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
009100 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
009200
009300 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
009400 FILE-CONTROL.
009500      SELECT USER-FILE    ASSIGN TO DATABASE-VALIDRCV
009600                          FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
009700
           SELECT MPLTINFO
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

009800 DATA DIVISION.
009900 FILE SECTION.
010000 FD  USER-FILE
010100     RECORD CONTAINS 12 CHARACTERS.
010200 01  USER-RCD                   PIC X(12).
010300
       FD  MPLTINFO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

011200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  ONLINE-LOCK               PIC X        VALUE "N".
       01  IDX                       PIC 9.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1         PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2         PIC X.
013700 01  PLANT-TYPE                PIC 9        VALUE ZERO.
013800     88  AKRON                              VALUE 1.
013900
014000 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER            PIC X(76)    VALUE SPACES.
014100***********************************************************
014200*                    T A B L E S                          *
014300***********************************************************
014400
014500*----------  VALID RECEIVING DEPARTMENTS AND SPOOLER NUMBERS
014600 01  USER-AREA                 PIC X(2400).
014700 01  USER-AREA-RD  REDEFINES USER-AREA.
014800     02  USER-DATA    OCCURS 200 TIMES
014900                      INDEXED BY U-X.
015000         05  USER-NAME-UA      PIC X(8).
015100         05  RCV-DPT-UA        PIC X(4).
015200
015300*----------  DIRECT DELIVERY ITEMS FOR SUBPLANTS
015400 01  DIRDEL-AREA                PIC X(60).
015500 01  DIRDEL-TABLE REDEFINES DIRDEL-AREA.
015600     02  PLANT-AREA OCCURS 6 TIMES.
015700         03  DIRDEL-STR-DEPT    PIC X(4).
015800         03  DIRDEL-DATE        PIC X(6).

       COPY AUTOSTOR IN COPYLIB.
015900
016000 01  P-A                        PIC 9  VALUE ZERO.
016200**************************************************************
016300*                 C A L L E D  R O U T I N E S               *
016400**************************************************************
016500*************************************************************
017710 01 DOCK-OVERSHIPMENT.
017720    05  CODED-OVERSHIPMENT     PIC 99       VALUE ZERO.
017730    05  NONCODED-OVERSHIPMENT  PIC 99       VALUE ZERO.
017740    05  CODED-RAW-OVERSHIPMENT PIC 99       VALUE ZERO.
017750    05  RAW-MATERIAL-GROUP.
017760        07  RM-GROUP OCCURS 6 TIMES PIC X(2).
017800 COPY TSPLPRT OF COPYLIB.
019600 COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD OF COPYLIB.
019800
019900 01  SPOOLER-ERROR-MSG.
020000     05  FILLER                PIC X(40)
020100         VALUE "NO MAIN SPOOLER NUMBER EXISTS FOR USER ".
020200     05  SP-USER               PIC X(8).
020300     05  FILLER                PIC X     VALUE ".".
020400     05  SP-ACCT               PIC X(8).
020500     05  FILLER                PIC X(4)  VALUE "DEV=".
020600     05  SP-DEV                PIC 9(2).
020800 01  PASSWORD            PIC X(8)   VALUE "JADE;   ".
020810 COPY DBMODES OF COPYLIB.
020820 COPY DBSTAT  OF COPYLIB.
021400
021800 01  MPLTINFO-ARG              PIC X(4)     VALUE "P 01".
021900
       COPY MPLTINFO OF COPYLIB.
021900
023200 COPY LANGUAGE OF COPYLIB.
023220 COPY ESCNAM2  OF COPYLIB.
023500 COPY DOCKMISC OF COPYLIB.
025300 COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYLIB.
025400
025500 01  FORMFILE.
025600     05  FORM-FNAME                PIC X(8)  VALUE "FUDCDOCK".
025700     05  FILLER                    PIC X     VALUE ".".
025800     05  FORM-GNAME.
025900         10  FORM-GNAME1           PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
026000         10  FORM-GNAME2           PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
026100     05  FILLER                    PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.
026300**************************************************************
026400**************************************************************
026500*                                                            *
026600*        P R O C E D U R E        D I V I S I O N            *
026700*                                                            *
026800**************************************************************
026900**************************************************************
027000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
027100 00-MAIN.
027110
027120     CALL "TESCSEQ" USING ESC-NAME.
027130
027200     PERFORM 100-OPEN-ALL THRU 109-EXIT.
027300
027400     PERFORM 130-INITIALIZATION THRU 139-EXIT.
027500
           IF A-KELLY-PLANT AND ONLINE-LOCK = "Y"
               DISPLAY "FUNCTION LOCKED, ONLY BATCH RECEIPTS ALLOWED"
           ELSE
               MOVE "ZUDCDOCK" TO VIEW-CFNAME
               MOVE "MD" TO PASS-DOCK-TRANS
027600         CALL "SCORRCVR" USING MISCELLANEOUS-DATA
027700                           VIEW-COMAREA
027710                           ESC-NAME,
027800                           USER-AREA
027900                           DIRDEL-AREA
                                 AUTOSTORE-AREA,
028100                           LANGUAGE-PARMS,
028110                           DOCK-OVERSHIPMENT.
028200
028300
028400     PERFORM 110-CLOSE-ALL THRU 119-EXIT.
028500
028600     GOBACK.
028800*************************************************************
028900*              O P E N   A L L   F I L E S                  *
029000*************************************************************
029100 100-OPEN-ALL.
032500
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO.
      *----------  FIND THE USER AND SPOOLER NUMBERS
           CALL "TSPLPRT" USING SP-RET-CODE, SP-AREA.
           IF SP-RET-CODE = "NF"
              MOVE "SPOOL KEY NOT FOUND * CORRCVR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT
           ELSE
           IF SP-RET-CODE NOT = "00"
              MOVE "TSPLPRT ERROR * CORRCVR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.

           MOVE SP-USERNAME        TO MISC-USER-NAME.
           MOVE SP-SPOOL-NO (1)    TO SPOOL-PRT-NO.
           MOVE SP-SPOOL-NO (2)    TO ACCTG-PRT-NO.
           MOVE SP-SPOOL-NO (3)    TO PRINT-PRT-NO.
034700 109-EXIT.  EXIT.
034800
034900***********************************************************
035000***********************************************************
035100*         CLOSE ALL FILES AND INITIALIZE USER KEYS        *
035200***********************************************************
035300***********************************************************
035400 110-CLOSE-ALL.
035500     CLOSE MPLTINFO.
036000 119-EXIT.  EXIT.
036200***********************************************************
036300***********************************************************
036400**    AKRON NEEDS TO VERIFY USERS.  READ IN THE FILE     **
036500**    CONTAING VALID USERS, DEPARTMENTS, AND SPOOLERS.   **
036600***********************************************************
036700***********************************************************
036800 130-INITIALIZATION.
033000*----------  FIND THE PLANT NUMBER AND PASS IT TO SUBROUTINES
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO INTO BUF-MPLTINFO INVALID KEY
                MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
033300     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
033400           MOVE "DBGET MPLTINFO - TDOCKUDC " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
033500           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
033600     MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY TO PLT-NUMBER-PASS.
033700     IF TELLS-WHICH-PLANT = "11"
033800        MOVE 1 TO PLANT-TYPE
033900     ELSE
034000        MOVE 0 TO PLANT-TYPE.
034100     MOVE SPACES TO USER-AREA, DIRDEL-AREA.

034320*-------  FIND PLANT SWITCH FOR P326 TO PASS TO SCORRCVR
034330     MOVE "P326" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO INTO BUF-MPLTINFO INVALID KEY
                MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
034360     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
               MOVE "N" TO MISC-P326-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-P326-SW TO MISC-P326-SW.
034110
034320*-------  FIND OVERSHIPMENT PERCENTAGES AND RAW MATERIAL MAJOR GROUPS
034330     MOVE "OVSH" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO INTO BUF-MPLTINFO INVALID KEY
                MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
034360     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
034370           MOVE "DBGET MPLTINFO2 - TDOCKUDC " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
034380           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
034390     MOVE MPLTINFO-CODED-OVSH-VALUE TO CODED-OVERSHIPMENT.
034391     MOVE MPLTINFO-NCODED-OVSH-VALUE TO NONCODED-OVERSHIPMENT.
034392     MOVE MPLTINFO-CODED-RM-OVSH-VALUE TO CODED-RAW-OVERSHIPMENT.
034393     MOVE MPLTINFO-RM-MAJOR-GROUP TO RAW-MATERIAL-GROUP.
           IF MPLTINFO-BATCH-ONLINE-LOCK = SPACES
               MOVE "N" TO ONLINE-LOCK
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-BATCH-ONLINE-LOCK TO ONLINE-LOCK.
034490
           MOVE 1 TO IDX.
           PERFORM 4 TIMES
               MOVE MPLTINFO-RM-STORED (IDX) TO AUTOSTR-AREA (IDX)
               ADD 1 TO IDX
           END-PERFORM.

034491     SET U-X TO 1.
034492     MOVE 1 TO P-A.
034500*----------  FIND THE STOREROOM DEPARTMENTS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY
034600     MOVE "DSTR" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO INTO BUF-MPLTINFO INVALID KEY
                MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
034900     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
035000           MOVE "DBGET MPLTINFO2 - TDOCKUDC " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
035100           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
035200     IF AKRON
035300        OPEN INPUT USER-FILE
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
03540             GO TO 135-READ-USER-FILE
              ELSE
                  GO TO 137-READ-DIRDEL-FILE
035500     ELSE
035600        GO TO 137-READ-DIRDEL-FILE.
035700
035800 135-READ-USER-FILE.
035900     READ USER-FILE INTO USER-DATA (U-X)
036000         AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               CLOSE USER-FILE
036100         GO TO 139-EXIT.
036200     SET U-X UP BY 1.
036300     GO TO 135-READ-USER-FILE.
036400 137-READ-DIRDEL-FILE.
036500     MOVE MPLTINFO-DEPT-STR (P-A)  TO DIRDEL-STR-DEPT (P-A).
036600     IF P-A = 6
036700        GO TO 139-EXIT.
036800     ADD 1 TO P-A.
036900     GO TO 137-READ-DIRDEL-FILE.
037000 139-EXIT.  EXIT.
041100************************************************************
041200*                    B L O W U P                           *
041300*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
041400*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
041500*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
041600*                                                          *
041700*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
041800*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
041900*                                                          *
042000*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
042200************************************************************
042300 990-BLOWUP.
042400     MOVE VIEW-NFNAME TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
042500     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
042600           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
042700           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
042800 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
042900
043000 999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
044600 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
044700     EXIT.
044800
